editor_description = "The red you see. use_collision is off on purpose -- a solid block would be new cover for the prisoners and a new occluder for the tower, and would give the avoidance-free runner brain something to grind against. It is sized by TrapVolume from the same size_metres the detection shape is, so the red and the kill cannot disagree."
