[node name="Trap03_164deg" type="Area3D" parent="Traps"]
editor_description = "164 deg. Hugs the INNER shoulder at r=40.75, so it spans r39.75-r41.75 and stops dead on r=41.75 -- the radius the LaneInner cover band already ends at. The runners' clear channel r41.75-r46.75 is untouched.\n\nThe box is 5 m along the track, 2.2 m tall and 2 m deep. 2.2 m is the number that matters: the tuned MovementProfile jumps 1.11 m, so this cannot be hopped and has to be gone around."
